---
description: Prisma and database conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

Use Prisma ORM.

## Models

Every model should include when appropriate:

- id
- createdAt
- updatedAt

## Relationships

Prefer relations over duplicated data.

Do not duplicate Shopify data unless necessary.

## Queries

Avoid N+1 query patterns.

Select only required fields.

## Migrations

Create small focused migrations.

Never modify production migrations.

## Repository Pattern

All Prisma queries belong inside repositories.

Routes should never directly access Prisma.

Services should not contain Prisma queries.

## Transactions

Use transactions whenever multiple writes must succeed together.

## Performance

Design for large datasets.

Use indexes where appropriate.

Paginate all large queries.